      "message": "[error] Line 2: 🔴 `buildHuawei` is inferred from `gradle.startParameter.taskRequests.toString().contains(\"Huawei\")`, which is brittle and can miss real Huawei builds (for example aggregate tasks like `assembleDebug`/`bundleDebug` that still include `withHuaweiPush` variants). In those cases the AGConnect plugin is not applied, so Huawei resources/config processing is skipped for the variant. Apply `com.huawei.agconnect` unconditionally in this module (or gate it on reliable variant/config detection) instead of parsing task request strings.",
